  "content": "<p>這根本就是一個跑酷地圖，沒什麼特別的</p><p>1.21x</p><p>我製作這張地圖時，跑酷文明正處於極度流行和熱門的趨勢，所以它包含了許多跑酷文明的參考元素</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2a506d88-8c24-4e54-bf40-f01ff1d029d7.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_67b8d465-e47c-4f72-9187-d90bce260a40.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cd8f1508-bc2e-482b-a4e3-8d51b9432f3f.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/view/basarweb/ana-sayfa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://sites.google.com/view/basarweb/ana-sayfa</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
